  "constraints": [
    "Generic Agent Runtime and business modules cannot import floe-experts-builtin.",
    "Business modules cannot import concrete vault/provider adapters or FFI.",
    "Inference and Connections have no dependency path to each other; both may use Access public API.",
    "Public cross-module APIs only; no mutable state or private repository sharing.",
    "Composition root may construct concrete services but must not select an Expert from request meaning.",
    "Shared physical storage does not grant cross-module table ownership."
